e in. Would also love to see a more ergonomic case/space-efficient carrying case. Otherwise no issues, love having a more sustainable option to keep products soaking into my skin for longer!","quote_span_id":"quote_0a225c98bd5cba29751b2a25","quote_status":"quote_available","quote_unavailable_cause":null},"reason_code":"easy_aftercare","relation":"support","selected_id":"selected_05"}
